1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,743
They called Doom a monster. Then the sky split open.

2
00:00:04,843 --> 00:00:07,957
And the only one holding your universe together... was him.

3
00:00:08,957 --> 00:00:10,368
Why aren't you saving everyone?

4
00:00:11,268 --> 00:00:12,479
I am.

5
00:00:13,679 --> 00:00:18,160
The price was one life. Erased from every timeline. Nobody volunteered.

6
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:19,925
Take mine.

7
00:00:21,525 --> 00:00:26,048
The sky healed. Your friends walked past you. Your own mother looked straight through you.

8
00:00:27,248 --> 00:00:29,665
Then Doom found you... and gave your watch back.

9
00:00:30,665 --> 00:00:32,034
You said everyone would forget.

10
00:00:32,834 --> 00:00:35,688
Everyone did. I never said I would.
